# Experiments content

Full checklist: `src/data/EXPERIMENTS.md`.

## Pipeline

1. Drop `*.mp4` in `src/assets/experiment-thumbnails-video/` (filename = what JSON references).
2. Append an object in `src/data/experiments.json`.
3. `experiments.ts` sets `videoUrl` via glob — never hand-edit `videoUrl` in JSON.

## Required JSON fields

`id`, `title`, `log` (e.g. `"19/52"`), `description`, `url`, `image`, `video`, `kind` (`image` | `music` | `video`), `tags[]`, `date` (`YYYY-MM-DD`), `body`.

- `video`: filename only, or `null`
- `url` / `image`: usually `null` unless linking out / static thumb

## UI behavior (don't break casually)

- Page: `Experiments` → `BrowserField` / `BrowserComponent`
- Hover: muted looping video; click: focus / Matter.js heap for others
- Exit: CRT wipe (`browser-crt-wipe` in CSS)

Prefer editing JSON + assets over rewriting physics/chrome unless asked.
